 "description": "Gerard2013 - Model 3 - Embryonic-type eukaryotic Cell Cycle regulation based on negative feedback between Cdk/cyclin and APC and competitive inhibition between Cdk/cyclin and securin for polyubiquitylation_1\nBioModels BIOMD0000000938 (curated). SBML file: Gerard2013.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 120 time units (SED-ML: Gerard2013.sedml), sampling 1.2.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 6.05e-07 of species peak (worst: Securin)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] species 'Anaphase_promoting_complex' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] Degradation_Cdk_mediated_by_APC_P: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Phosphorylation_of_APC term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Dephosphorylation_of_APC: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Degradation_of_Sec_mediated_by_APC_P: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): AnaphasepromotingcomplexP1 = Anaphase_promoting_complex_Phosphorylated; Anaphasepromotingcomplext1 = Anaphase_promoting_complex_total",
